= Otto Thiel

Otto Thiel is a politician and unionist affiliated with the DHV, the right-wing trade union federation.

- @labor_affairs
- @white_collar
- @union_unity
- @grassroots_fundraising
- @root: Return to main

@labor_affairs
title: Labor Policy
subtitle: Enact labor policies.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and dvp_in_government and labor_minister_party = dvp_name
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not dvp_in_government : The <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span> is not currently in government. ?][? if justice_minister_party != dvp_name : We do not have the Justice Ministry. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; labor_rights_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: labor_rights


@white_collar
title: Organizing white-collar workers
subtitle: Improve our standing among the new middle class.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] 
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; new_middle_dvp += 3*(1-dissent); workers_dvp += 1*(1-dissent);

We have increased our organizing among white-collar workers.


@union_unity
title: Union-party coordination
subtitle: Reduce dissent among the unions.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; labor_dissent -= 10;

We have reduced tensions with the Labor faction.


@grassroots_fundraising
title: Grassroots Fundraising
subtitle: Request more resources from party members.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; dues += 1 if dues < 5; resources += 2; labor_strength += 5; new_middle_dvp -= 2

We have increased dues and requested donations from party members.

We have gained +2 resources.
